Today is my first day at the office.
I am very happy.
I get ready early in the morning.
I pack my bag.
What is in my bag?
I have my laptop.
I also have my ID document.
This ID document is very important.
I work in a software company.
I check all the items.
I also have a water bottle.
But I realize one thing.
I do not have an Indian phone number.
I have my phone.
But I do not have a local SIM card.
I want a new number.
Later, I get a new SIM card.
Now, I go to the office.
